  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "~ WHY YOU WILL LOVE \"BAYTOWNE BOARDWALK 2\" ~<br>• Magazine-Worthy Spa Retreat overlooking the Baytowne Golf Course<br>• Two Golf Carts Included — one 6-seater and one 4-seater<br>• Large Screened-In Porch with comfortable seating and a Smart TV overlooking the golf course<br>• First-Floor Master Suite with a luxurious spa-style bathroom<br>• Curbless Walk-In Shower featuring body jets and dual showerheads<br>• Multiple Resort Pools, including one heated year-round<br>• Minutes from The Village of Baytowne Wharf — shops, dining & entertainment<br>• Golf Cart Access to the Beach, Publix grocery store, and Grand Boulevard<br>• Private Resort Beach Access exclusive to guests<br>• 5 Minutes to Grand Boulevard, home to upscale shopping, restaurants, and a movie theater<br><br>~ THE SPACE ~<br>Enjoy \"Baytowne Boardwalk 2\", a beautifully appointed 3,300 square foot vacation home located in the exclusive Sandestin Golf & Beach Resort in Miramar Beach, Florida. This spacious and thoughtfully designed 4-bedroom, 4.5-bathroom retreat offers a main floor master king suite and blends of comfort, privacy, and resort-style amenities — perfect for families, multi-generational groups, or couples traveling together. This home features an amazing community pool within walking distance and enjoy access to the HEATED Phil Hummel Aquatic Center Pool off Baypine Dr. Guests will enjoy the use of a 6 & 4 seat golf cart, making it easy to explore all that Sandestin has to offer—from the beach to the Village of Baytowne Wharf.<br><br>The home's open-concept living space invites relaxation and connection, with a large sectional sofa, smart TV, and coastal-inspired decor. The fully equipped kitchen features granite countertops, stainless steel appliances, and everything you need to prepare meals during your stay. Dine together at the spacious table or grab a casual bite at the breakfast bar. Step outside to the private screened-in patio, a peaceful spot for morning coffee or evening cocktails. A convenient half bath is also located on the first floor.<br><br>Each of the four bedrooms at \"Baytowne Boardwalk 2\" includes a private en-suite bathroom, offering every guest both comfort and privacy. The first-floor king suite is ideal for those who prefer main-level accommodations. Its spa-style bathroom features a curbless walk-in shower with both handheld and stationary showerheads, plus four body massage jets. A dual-sink vanity, dedicated makeup vanity, and separate water closet provide plenty of space and convenience. Upstairs, the second king suite includes a private bathroom with a walk-in shower and its own balcony overlooking the scenic Baytowne Golf Course. Down the hall, the queen suite offers another private bath, while the bunk room suite—furnished with two twin-over-twin bunk beds—comfortably sleeps up to four guests and features its own en-suite bathroom as well. Additional amenities include a full-size washer and dryer in a spacious laundry room, high-speed Wi-Fi, smart TVs in every bedroom, and driveway parking for two vehicles.<br><br>* Room Details *<br>Master King Suite, Private Bathroom (1st floor)<br>Guest King Suite, Private Bathroom (2nd floor)<br>Guest Queen Suite, Private Bathroom (2nd floor)<br>Guest Bunk Suite (2 twin over twin bunk sets), Private Bathroom (2nd floor)<br>Laundry Area (2nd floor)<br><br>* Amenity Details *<br>Community Pool | Not Heated<br>Phil Hummel Resort Pool | Heated<br>6 & 4 Seat Golf Cart<br>Many backpack beach chairs and a beach wagon for use<br>1 bike available for guest use<br><br>* Special Attention Rules *<br>ON SITE 24 hour (HOA) Homeowner Association Manager<br>NO Pets, NO Smoking<br>NO Parties or Events<br>Must be 30 to book, NO College Spring Breakers / Families style rentals only<br>​​​​​​​Property is equipped with exterior security monitoring<br>NO more than 2 Vehicles, NO street parking, Garage for golf cart only<br>Mailbox is not for guest use<br>Sandestin Beach Access Update – Effective May 1, 2025, Sandestin Golf & Beach Resort has implemented a paid parking policy for all vehicles, including golf carts, at the resort's beach access point. The daily parking fee is $20, and guests will pay Sandestin directly for parking.<br><br>~ THE AREA ~<br>Sandestin Resort is an amazing vacation spot! Its family friendly atmosphere will keep you coming back for years. Baytowne Wharf is a beautiful pedestrian outdoor plaza with retail stores and restaurants overlooking the bay. For child friendly fun visit the Baytowne BlastArcade & Laser Maze or head to the Baytowne Adventure Zone to zip across the lagoon on the Baytowne Zipline or try your skills on the Sky Trail Ropes aerial obstacle course. If they still haven't had enough fun, the Tower Climb and Eurobungy are attractions sure to thrill them. Smaller children will be delighted to explore the Baytowne Adventure Landing Playground. Relax while the kids play on this imaginative nautical themed playground with slides and towers galore. This is a large enclosed fenced area, where kids can climb, swing, run and play to their hearts content.<br><br>Sandestin has many other exciting things to offer. Take a trip to the Marina and eat lunch on the water while watching the Yachts and Sailboats explore the bay. La Dolce Vita at the Marina offers pontoon and Jet Ski rentals for hours of family fun. Sandestin also features amazing golf courses, tennis courts, a SPA and a Fitness Center for additional fees. Sandestin is golf cart friendly! That means you can take the golf cart anywhere in Sandestin and even to the Grand Boulevard Plaza.<br><br>Explore Grand Boulevard for exclusive boutiques, renowned retailers, specialty shops and mouthwatering culinary creations from an array of casual and fine dining restaurant including Tommy Bahamas, Vin'tij, Grimaldi's, Cantina Laredo and Fleming's Steakhouse. Grand Boulevard features live entertainment, exciting outdoor events and a 10-screen movie theater.<br><br>~ WHY YOU WILL LOVE RENTING FROM BEACH LUXURY VACATIONS ~<br>• Locally owned and operated boutique management company<br>• Premier Hosting Partner on world-class booking platforms<br>• Consistently top-rated for cleanliness and guest experience<br>• Our team lives within 20 minutes of our homes for fast local support<br>• True locals with insider dining and activity recommendations<br>• Personalized assistance with golf carts, bike rentals, beach services, and more<br>• Trusted local connections—we recommend what we use with our own families<br>• Hands-on, attentive hosting focused on long-term guest relationships<br><br>Disclaimer: Beach Luxury Vacations, LLC is an independent company that is not affiliated with, sponsored by or associated with any entity containing the word “Sandestin.” Any use or reference to the word “Sandestin” is in the dictionary or factual sense to identify a property or location and not to suggest any affiliation with any SANDESTIN® branded entity, product or service.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
